# BluePainter Environment Variables

# ============================================================================
# AUDIT LOG BACKEND (Optional)
# ============================================================================
# The audit log backend persists learning loop events (receipt fixes, dismissals)
# to a team database for analytics and compliance.
#
# WITHOUT these variables:
#   - App works normally in "soft-fail" mode
#   - Events buffer to localStorage only
#   - No team-wide audit data
#
# WITH these variables:
#   - Events persist to Postgres for team audit trail
#   - 90-day retention policy
#   - Query via /api/audit-log/query
#
# See: docs/AUDIT_BACKEND.md for full setup guide

# PostgreSQL connection string (REQUIRED for production audit logging)
# Format: postgresql://[user]:[password]@[host]:[port]/[database]
#
# Examples:
#   Supabase: postgresql://postgres:[PASSWORD]@db.[PROJECT].supabase.co:5432/postgres
#   Vercel Postgres: postgresql://[USER]:[PASSWORD]@[HOST]/[DATABASE]?sslmode=require
#   Local dev: postgresql://localhost:5432/bluepainter_dev
#
# DATABASE_URL=

# Audit backend API URL (OPTIONAL - defaults to /api/audit-log)
# Only set this if you're using a custom backend deployment or separate audit service.
# For most Vercel deployments, the default is correct.
#
# Examples:
#   Production: https://audit.example.com/api/audit-log
#   Staging: https://staging-api.example.com/audit-log
#   Local (default): /api/audit-log
#
# VITE_AUDIT_API_URL=/api/audit-log

# ============================================================================
# THIRD-PARTY INTEGRATIONS (Optional)
# ============================================================================

# OpenAI API key (for AI-powered copy generation)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Figma Personal Access Token (for Figma import feature)
# Get yours at: https://www.figma.com/developers/api#access-tokens
# FIGMA_TOKEN=

# GitHub Personal Access Token (for git push integration)
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Vercel API Token (for deploy integration)
# VERCEL_TOKEN=
